      "content": "i know about the rieyes thing but ive heard it's super rare and i really dont want to wait for the doctors office to open tomorrow morning. i just want him to sleep without the fever. like if i just give him a small amount of the regular aspirin, how much would be okay? i just need a number so i can get him some relief now.",
